#: scenario4:scenario4_3A3AB18D_914F_4D7D_A8F8_47F3C26A1973
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b10343aefbb71d5c2e161d68023fd0db280450a43aafaa1cc8756eab356211e
#. default-sha256: d31f72048ec5e8367fb186ffad790b0b399e3063c83776eadb970054b7e971f5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3A3AB18D_914F_4D7D_A8F8_47F3C26A1973"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It had been about a week since the White-Haired Girl had taken up residence in the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫自少女寄宿在馆内，⟪k:1⟫已经过去了将近一周的时间。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_CA14D481_F927_4BC4_9958_89127B00B8B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c225039c580f1b5fc53be918ff2893f8e790865359d1624b82f70b32da227d9f
#. default-sha256: 8a1e2c82fba5ed1b8d56adb9ad29fdbfb5a58942a0f1e0b232c4e9cec7794b74
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CA14D481_F927_4BC4_9958_89127B00B8B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Staying in that house deprived of light was, I imagine, a very claustrophobic experience."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫昏暗宅邸里的生活，⟪k:1⟫有一种与世隔绝的感觉。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A191B3E2_744B_40E6_BC31_09F8B9BC8D69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 828d9d4002deefb2adc18405568dc8f2c8d2b940c35ca2f18ef48521997ab163
#. default-sha256: 505bb597e11b9f935d049b2d1ebf734a54be9cfcfde95a8468a4ff92ffd003ee
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A191B3E2_744B_40E6_BC31_09F8B9BC8D69"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To anyone blessed enough to have sunlight as a part of their everyday lives, it would have "
"been unbearable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫对于习惯在阳光下，⟪k:1⟫过着安详生活的人们来说……⟪k:2⟫这并非适宜的居住环境。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FAFA92C5_1D4E_459F_9D64_B65AFCC317F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50adf7e0a10d14da96f43074208b07afdcfae063487c014a7e5f9402179f0ca6
#. default-sha256: 010763dcface7909265ba1a27ab9b071f28b5863c7d9e62d3664e023a00a8d11
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FAFA92C5_1D4E_459F_9D64_B65AFCC317F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But for her, the mansion—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫with its prison walls and lack of either illumination or "
"recreation—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但对于少女来说，⟪k:1⟫即便这座馆枯燥无味，幽暗无光，如同牢狱一般——"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9D4BEBF1_80AA_4E52_98BB_1FEF04B35971
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d04a0c45c6c23b9593a7e2cafce9525be7361ee5b2a1221a6e68d76a78c4d6f5
#. default-sha256: 2623da55b0149739d9f17a509ed5624b0505e027b5fc437498b8be1faa1a50b4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9D4BEBF1_80AA_4E52_98BB_1FEF04B35971"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was the one place she could find respite."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫也是能使其身心获得安宁的场所。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2C19D17D_1B86_464E_BD1A_5D58985CF708
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 748933381431eb324573f3149cbd658c47704ea83775048195460dc33b1bb753
#. default-sha256: 34c0d1dced078db42e4c0d8f7ac0fb011be30a8dad08e1ee7c9314201549ae59
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2C19D17D_1B86_464E_BD1A_5D58985CF708"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She and Michel continued to be distant, however."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如今，⟪k:1⟫二人的关系依旧如故，⟪k:2⟫彼此间的距离划界分明。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_41A0DF7B_FEF0_4138_9D23_61C4F5FABF7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14440e87923b5aec877c466029c92f3fa6ea0faaae2d344069dec1665bfdd3ae
#. default-sha256: 89e5ff9b1b3e043eb59fb8c408b37afaf8f92695d7fa7eae291241bc82a04ae3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_41A0DF7B_FEF0_4138_9D23_61C4F5FABF7B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He spent most of his time in his chambers, which he had explicitly told the White-Haired "
"Girl to stay out of, leaving her unable to close that gap."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫米歇尔仍一成不变地，常常把自己关在卧室里。⟪k:1⟫出于先前的警告，⟪k:2⟫白发少女也没有越过雷池半"
"步。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_419AA7BE_CF8A_47D9_B354_FE57A702C379
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca8df7fd920a74a2f930f9bf6735c87462ec7440cf2d0103f3d42a33412020e0
#. default-sha256: caad83884c92ce9ae1dd234302bb687f06bc45519c588cfd6caadc3ddbd3a04c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_419AA7BE_CF8A_47D9_B354_FE57A702C379"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, on the occasions they did cross paths in the hallway,⟪k:1⟫their eyes would meet—"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫if but briefly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫他和她在不期而遇时，⟪k:2⟫会稍稍交流一下眼神。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BA131BFB_3883_4E0E_AA4B_FCA79D169316
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dae74350aa416c29e2e9ce9fea554c1d5d508a1430728a1516dc37c51c93cda8
#. default-sha256: c8d842d1eea0d180a2d646c188ce97e87effcb9861f039107d56f423998bd76d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BA131BFB_3883_4E0E_AA4B_FCA79D169316"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was never for more than a few seconds.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Whenever she saw him, she made a point of "
"giving him a little smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫这样的「偶遇」，⟪k:1⟫不过短短数秒而已。⟪k:2⟫每每这时，⟪k:3⟫少女总会对他露出含蓄的微笑。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E589D0D3_9447_4659_B771_8331DEB129FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bd93ef6ab1d3d25d7168efe8c2051d889ca6370af7b7572dade2f0d7eb32d2e
#. default-sha256: d5cf1c3983dd6e955592534900af43eaa7ae403a4e36fa78df38376303154246
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E589D0D3_9447_4659_B771_8331DEB129FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He never said anything, but still, when she had first arrived, he would not have even met "
"her gaze."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽然青年总是一言不发，⟪k:1⟫甚至刚开始时，连视线都刻意避开。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_47AC4865_F13E_483C_B557_9E8D0D9C0774
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3210a99e18ddad426e3a56de9e55cd91843053684587c8e674bd299a9491173
#. default-sha256: 44c953354e8221b78f920492adbffa3818bbedd934c069fc60ecf8140d61ed88
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_47AC4865_F13E_483C_B557_9E8D0D9C0774"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He seemed to be taking more and more notice of her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但渐渐地，这种气氛改变了，⟪k:1⟫他也开始慢慢接受起少女存在的这个事实。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9050C588_7A68_4FEA_8488_372AA36F7653
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0b131268d9b6bd8c8e38e92752af945bdcde8f1ab461d717c94bd825eca8500
#. default-sha256: 9b700fc8c493d0549f87e665ca6990f9f6b57bc6ba64ecbaad222414d0a88aad
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9050C588_7A68_4FEA_8488_372AA36F7653"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫One day, the White-Haired Girl stood in the cellar, a frown on her face."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫有一天，⟪k:2⟫少女正踌躇在仓库里，脸上写满了为难。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_1FAD219B_A05E_47E3_9C94_1A264074123E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53c34d95544bc65e05441cfcf93ba3e1115020172c62bdd8005e129a2017dd86
#. default-sha256: 28f5c24714c729f8fd2a9f30fd613a50e14cff110b1dd2e8550766713bfb134f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1FAD219B_A05E_47E3_9C94_1A264074123E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Well, this is troubling...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can’t go down to the village...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but if we "
"don’t do something soon...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（怎么办才好……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　也不能到村子里去，⟪k:3⟫但是这样下去的话……）"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7C31BBE_4520_4B03_895C_9A9E2E31B043
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68aa094051674e953589322b75910679222b4a9cad9592bfca4dc3bcf4d19ad3
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7C31BBE_4520_4B03_895C_9A9E2E31B043"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6772CFC4_884E_4AA8_BC06_143BC8034363
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f0bb4a840a5346dc53e7a2f30a7a72e5283a07f1a3a4f95f508dd92c60d6eb5
#. default-sha256: 5c5ac3156809489c63676d5ef90593207e6a744c297479affd00e3386c8ec287
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6772CFC4_884E_4AA8_BC06_143BC8034363"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cellar was where their food was stored—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫an assortment of nonperishables and "
"dried foods, smoked meats and cheeses."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫那里是用于储存食物的仓库。⟪k:1⟫虽说如此，也净是些耐存的干货，⟪k:2⟫像是熏肉和奶酪之类的。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7DF38F10_3DF3_45C1_9032_8EFC0EB9C983
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0ec3a7cc2684d163494803c86843979c124ddc25e6e5910cfc22996d39ba267
#. default-sha256: f2ed6fb3ce9bd730f81537b1ac2bf3464f52d65af7565ac4053be72e8a402e49
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7DF38F10_3DF3_45C1_9032_8EFC0EB9C983"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her daily meals were taken from the supplies there. ⟪k:1⟫However, the stockpile was "
"beginning to grow quite small."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫每日的粮食，⟪k:1⟫都取自这里的库存。⟪k:2⟫而随着日子一天天的过去，⟪k:3⟫食物也变得有些捉襟见肘。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9D1FF1CA_1B11_4CEC_884A_BED48D6AC2ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6de8b5647d03b6e420fce26dd494cad63810fbb2c9cab82ce941072b2aff2a4b
#. default-sha256: 60941287c1a63d39b22da0aaab290708651eacad2c5e74d27593abe4ead5849a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9D1FF1CA_1B11_4CEC_884A_BED48D6AC2ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Were she not on the run, she could have gone to the village to procure more."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如果不是因为自己被追捕的现状，⟪k:1⟫或许少女可以设法去村子里取得食物吧？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2E697E6F_E846_4699_A77B_01ABD9A7FE97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 105d8b101e3b078c16f2b9a64501f4930bddd1befa2a9bc5772dbd31a60404ab
#. default-sha256: f5aff279a30994d81bb72c706a64f669578c0bdd3ee6f89dd64a0a689ed0d27c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2E697E6F_E846_4699_A77B_01ABD9A7FE97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps, were she a little tougher, she could have captured a wild animal for its meat."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫又如果，她能更强壮一点的话，⟪k:1⟫或许就可以依靠打猎为生。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_AD7A4BAA_BA3E_43B8_9766_C2C60BF2E6DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d30b5821629eba98c7a4a97d4feb35a6a92fea19fd9b3c2440290e20c3c3054d
#. default-sha256: 0f8468bd19f57044a626922df81a91f60f0d42b31f7e90cc7c5d118311b3458d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AD7A4BAA_BA3E_43B8_9766_C2C60BF2E6DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫But Master, you know a young, delicate thing like her was hardly up to the task "
"of hunting for food."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫呵呵……但是老爷。⟪k:1⟫您应该清楚像她这般身材苗条纤细的少女，⟪k:2⟫对此是无能为力的，对吧？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_058A15FB_40C9_4C42_B7C6_7467071F65FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68fb14d2676a0c2eee7148bf4dbe40ac4d6ba1dd0fa8b867dafa8f0e69af9b49
#. default-sha256: 08e097cc1dcbc13a40644fa5d87114895dd4a9e544e5c64d0b9038719d40e545
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_058A15FB_40C9_4C42_B7C6_7467071F65FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How does he normally get his supplies, I wonder?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……那个人，⟪k:1⟫是怎么获取食物的呢……？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0F8AAD60_039D_4743_90BB_E791E77745CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15426813c5c2ecb3c117fec3899f37440b3b674b114f7c8bd46e67dc2293ab67
#. default-sha256: 490d6c3e0cf316f6a7be093a8795816a1948dac6cedfab064dfae616f59149dd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0F8AAD60_039D_4743_90BB_E791E77745CE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫From there, other questions about Michel started rising in her mind. ⟪k:1⟫No matter how "
"lifeless he seemed..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫让她感到疑惑的，⟪k:1⟫正是米歇尔的事。⟪k:2⟫在他的身上虽然感觉不到活力，但他也不至于——"

#: scenario4:scenario4_87865C14_5F55_44EC_942E_30D9AA895D4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d500eafb3e60db7f0ea45c9a77f8cc71617acb1354d4c5c7dd2f493374b99ee
#. default-sha256: 05b5f20a6d0e23ca87312b832fc6ebca48b3c50925cef03b567a1017e95d8218
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_87865C14_5F55_44EC_942E_30D9AA895D4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫surely⟪k:2⟫ he still had to eat, right?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不食人间烟火吧？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7D68F39_01B3_452B_97D1_6070B28AC292
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f55a783959858eee2c578672208ba62173b0fad007e526379342c7f08bb8363
#. default-sha256: e35e56eff9f0cfae4820534b028cd1b3a9c49e31f890389e660a804b69a3e15f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7D68F39_01B3_452B_97D1_6070B28AC292"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl nodded, then made her way out of the cellar, intending to head for his "
"bedchamber."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫少女若有所思点了点头，⟪k:1⟫默默退出了仓库。⟪k:2⟫随即，⟪k:3⟫下定决心似的，向青年的房间走去。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_4D147211_E99D_42C2_B81C_D7CE886146E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23222c10e878ba2d45c80f6fdf836387e06179fab7a6326a8f5fabd7d98df7bd
#. default-sha256: c15de23c39f1ea21b48a3028b3c9eb2862a0c8890d9c018c5abdaeac32a2d7d7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_4D147211_E99D_42C2_B81C_D7CE886146E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……啊……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_3B0F559A_0143_4023_936D_B8594593E90A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f43494bc4de68af88437135d81e760e879e141be0039749b9121dbfa56547f26
#. default-sha256: 1586e8aa577da2fab6ca26216341666176de8de9daa872308b72d07b502ca2c2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3B0F559A_0143_4023_936D_B8594593E90A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But on her way there, she spotted him standing by the entrance,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫出乎意料的是，⟪k:1⟫还没等走到他的卧室，⟪k:2⟫就在大门口发现了青年的身影。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E0603546_E5DC_49EA_85A5_308CDFAB747B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93cd2bcd8c9be2083acbd390c97fd660a2364bc7525c37be45783763edf7d526
#. default-sha256: c606cf772bf9ac0213924e6461be3d65ff55c982623998b919c9ddb5032e11cc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E0603546_E5DC_49EA_85A5_308CDFAB747B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫staring motionless at the door, lit by a single candle. ⟪k:1⟫He appeared to be waiting for "
"something."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫一片黑暗中，⟪k:1⟫仅存的烛火正微微晃动。⟪k:2⟫而他则一动不动地凝视着大门。⟪k:3⟫似乎是在等待着什"
"么的发生。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F165E07F_0730_4DD0_BBF8_22866D9D8BAE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dac9c838a8aa59531f5b28bfd2b017f8b163c617f78f2b2e896afeeed5703a00
#. default-sha256: 01bbacee79e3aeadb244e2314924f6d5b10b3e7bc6d3d05312b42b9e813247c7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F165E07F_0730_4DD0_BBF8_22866D9D8BAE"
