msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The color of her eyes made them quite sensitive to light already, so when she stepped "
"outside, her whole world went bone white."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫视线变得一片雪白。⟪k:1⟫更加危险的就是，⟪k:2⟫她淡色的瞳孔原本就见不得强光。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C2786865_DC4D_41E8_BA59_715BA2D60274
